msgid "**Administrators and domain managers:** `files/python/rbac_sync.py <./files/python/rbac_sync.py>`__ sets ``global_admin`` from the ``web-app-mailu`` ``administrator`` members and the managers of the mail domain from the ``domain-manager`` members through the Mailu REST API inside the admin container. Members are promoted, every other global administrator and domain manager is demoted. The platform administrator stays a global administrator. It runs as a host hook of `sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync <../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/>`__ at every deploy and on its timer."
