msgid "**Health Badges**: every tile shows the state the webserver health sweep wrote to `/status.json` (running, paused by Semaphore, degraded, down, unknown); `services.dashboard.status` sets the poll interval and the age after which an entry counts as unknown, and `services.dashboard.status.enabled: false` switches the badges off."
