msgid "**Patched OAuth2 callback:** The role builds ``gitea_custom`` instead of running ``gitea/gitea`` unchanged. The role `Dockerfile <./files/Dockerfile>`__ compiles the backend from the ``gitea-src`` tarball of the pinned release with every patch in ``GITEA_PATCH_FILES`` applied, and replaces ``/app/gitea/gitea`` in the pinned upstream image. `oauth2/redirect-uri-public-url.patch <./files/patch/oauth2/redirect-uri-public-url.patch>`__ takes the OAuth2 callback URL from the public URL the request arrived on instead of ``ROOT_URL``, so an SSO sign-in started on the onion vhost returns to the onion callback. Drop that patch once a Gitea release carries the change."
