# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-IN** on a non-swarm host: explicitly rejected. Swarm mode is exclusively triggered by group membership. The per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` override only opts OUT on a swarm host, never opts IN on a non-swarm host."
msgstr "**Per-role opt-IN** på en ikke-svarm vert: eksplisitt avvist. Swarm-modus utløses utelukkende av gruppemedlemskap. Per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` overstyrer bare velger ut på en sverm vert, aldri velger IN på en ikke-svarm vert."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-role opt-OUT** on a swarm host: a role MAY override `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` in its `vars/main.yml` to stay on the compose path even when the host is in `svc-swarm-node`. Role vars win over `group_vars/all` by Ansible precedence."
msgstr "**Per-role opt-OUT** på en sverm vert: en rolle kan tilsidesette `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` i sin `vars/main.yml` å holde seg på komponeringsstien selv når verten er i `svc-swarm-node`. Rolle vars vinner over `group_vars/all` av ansible forrang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Per-round variant selection.** In round R every primary app uses variant index `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. So a single-variant app stays on variant 0 in every round, and a 3-variant app in a 5-round deploy follows `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`."
msgstr "**Per runde variantvalg.** I rund R bruker hver primær app variantindeks `R if R < its_variant_count else 0`. Så en enkeltvariant app forblir på variant 0 i hver runde, og 3-variant app i en 5-runde distribusjon følger `0, 1, 2, 0, 0`.."

msgid "**Per-vhost decisions.** One vhost per sibling. TLS, injected snippets, CSP, redirects and health probes are decided by the vhost domain, and every cross-app URL rendered into a vhost comes from that vhost's network."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Per-vhost parameters move into meta, per domain, without exceptions.** Every value an include site passes today moves into the role's meta, keyed by domain. This includes the multi-vhost roles (Matrix, Stalwart, Bluesky and the others listed below)."
