msgid "**Reporting Vulnerabilities** If you discover a security vulnerability in Infinito.Nexus, you MUST report it immediately through [SECURITY.md](../../SECURITY.md) and MUST NOT open a public issue. We encourage proactive vulnerability reporting so that issues can be addressed as quickly as possible."
msgstr "**Rapportering** Hvis du oppdager en sikkerhet sårbarhet i Infinito.Nexus, Du må rapportere det umiddelbart gjennom [SECURITY.md](../../SECURITY.md) Må ikke åpne et offentlig problem. Vi oppfordrer til proaktiv sårbarhetsrapportering slik at problemer kan håndteres så raskt som mulig."

msgid "**Repository Clone:** A role that passes ``compose_repository_url`` and ``compose_repository_ref`` gets a shallow clone of that ref in ``compose_repository_path``. The role declares on its primary entity in ``meta/services.yml`` whether the ref is a ``tag`` or a ``branch`` as ``ref_kind``, beside the ``ref`` or ``source_version`` it pins; the clone fetches ``+refs/tags/<ref>:refs/tags/<ref>`` for a tag and no extra refspec for a branch. Check the kind with ``git ls-remote <repository> <ref>``, never from the name."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Repository Clone:** A role that passes `compose_repository_url` and `compose_repository_ref` gets a shallow clone of that ref in `compose_repository_path`. The role declares on its primary entity in `meta/services.yml` whether the ref is a `tag` or a `branch` as `ref_kind`, beside the `ref` or `source_version` it pins; the clone fetches `+refs/tags/<ref>:refs/tags/<ref>` for a tag and no extra refspec for a branch. Check the kind with `git ls-remote <repository> <ref>`, never from the name."
