msgid "**Role-strategy authorisation:** Map the RBAC groups of ``meta/rbac.yml`` onto the global roles ``admin`` (``administrator``), ``developer`` (create, configure, build and delete jobs) and ``viewer`` (read jobs and builds) through the ``role-strategy`` plugin. The OIDC realm matches the group paths of the groups claim, the LDAP realm matches the ``web-app-jenkins-<role>`` group names under the roles OU. A signed-in account without one of these groups is refused."
