msgid "**Schema.** Every role whose sign-in offers more than one method in any mode declares `services.<entity>.login.method.<method>.enabled` under its own entity in `meta/services.yml`. The methods are `sso`, `ldap`, `native` and `2fa`, plus the extras an app actually has: `passkey`, `openid2` (Gitea), `odoo_com` (Odoo), `email` (Fider magic link) and `registration` (local self-registration)."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Scope is the full backlog, executed in phases.** The definition of done is the FULL set: every ✅ cell in the matrix wired as an addon, and an exhaustive per-`web-app-*`-role upstream-plugin survey completed so the ✅ layer is exhaustive rather than hub-biased. Delivery is phased: the shared contract plus the first-slice roles land first (see [Implementation Strategy](#implementation-strategy)), then the remaining roles and ✅ wirings sweep incrementally, but no phase reduces scope. The requirement is not complete until the full ✅ set is wired and every `web-app-*` role surveyed."
msgstr "**Omfang er full backlog, utført i faser.** Definisjonen er det fulle settet: hver ✅ celle i matrisen som er kablet som en addon, og en uttømmende per-`web-app-*`-role oppstrømsplugin undersøkelse fullført så ✅ Laget er uttømmende i stedet for nav-partisk. Levering fases: den delte kontrakten pluss den første-slice roller land først (se [Gjennomføringsstrategi](#implementation-strategy))og de gjenværende rollene og ✅ ledninger feier gradvis, men ingen fase reduserer omfanget. Kravet er ikke fullført før hele ✅ Settet er kablet og alle `web-app-*` rolle undersøkt."

msgid "**Scope.** In-scope roles are invokable, carry a lifecycle inside the tested envelope (every status a `ci-deploy` context in `meta/lifecycle.yml` deploys), and expose a web UI. A `web-app-` or `web-svc-` role without a UI to design sets `design.enabled: false` in its `meta/services.yml` with `# nocheck: design-off  Reason: <text>`, which a lint enforces, and `make design-queue` skips it: `web-app-bridgy-fed`, `web-app-mig` (operator decision), `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-collabora`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-onlyoffice`, `web-svc-simpleicons` and `web-svc-xmpp`."
msgstr ""

