msgid "A role never names another role directly. It names a service key in its ``meta/services.yml``, and the key resolves to the role that provides it; an add-on under ``meta/addons/`` reaches the same provider by naming that key in its ``bridges:`` list. The two pages below list both sides for every ``web-app-*`` and ``web-svc-*`` role, regenerated from the roles on each build."
