# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Cross-service-sonder (biber nektet ved prometheus, biber nektet ved matomo, dashboard flis rekkevidde) er ikke en del av per-role biber persona. De lever i leverandørens egen spesifikasjon (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterisert en gang over leverandørens `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For dashboard, den parameteriserte scenario delegater til `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, som eier flis synlighet / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" Pop-out-påstander i en spot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Tverrtjenestesonder er ikke en del av den enkelte administratorpersona. Dashboard flis rekkevidde eies av `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, som delegerer per-mål kroppen til `runDashboardCardScenario` Hjelper i `dashboard-card-flow.js` (flis synlig → klikk på belastninger i `#main iframe` → overskrift \"Tab\" knappen popper inn i en ny nettleser fane). Den hjelperen er SPOT for dashboard-til-mekanikk; forbrukerspesifikasjoner må ikke implementere noen av disse påstandene. Prometheus admin-reach og skrape paritet eies av `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach og tracker tilstedeværelse eies av `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Hver leverandør parameteriserer påstanden over sin `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Overflatepåstander (dashboard flis rekkevidde, prometheus admin-reach og skrape paritet, matomo admin-reach og tracker tilstedeværelse, biber-deied-at-prometheus, biber-deied-at-matomo) Eies av leverandørens egen spesifikasjon. Hver leverandør parameteriserer påstanden over sin `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifestert, gjengitt via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Forbrukerrollers personas må ikke kopiere disse proben."

