msgstr "Dropper eller trekker backing-databasen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drops the per-entity default Docker network when `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong / empty `com.docker.compose.network` label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop. Idempotent."
msgstr "Dropper det per-entity standard Docker-nettverket når `compose.sh` Legg den bak seg med feil / tom `com.docker.compose.network` etikett (typisk mellom matrise-demploy runder). Hopper over fjerning når nettverket fremdeles har aktive containerendpoints, så delte tjenestenettverk (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres,...) Opphold på plass mens leverandørbeholderen er oppe. Den globale `docker network prune -f` feie som fanger foreldreløse hvis navn ikke samsvarer med enheten drives én gang av orkesterføreren [apps.sh](../apps.sh) etter enhetens loop. Ideelt."

