# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The [alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) repository is the RECOMMENDED way to define CLI shortcuts so frequently used commands do not have to be retyped. The effective repository is the `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` value in the generated `.env`."
msgstr "Den [alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) Lager er den ubesvarte måten å definere CLI-snarveier så ofte brukte kommandoer trenger ikke å skrives om. Det effektive lageret er `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` verdi i den genererte `.env`.."

msgid "The [applications_carrier](../../../../../../plugins/action/applications_carrier.py) action parks the rendered users next to the applications in the host fact `_INFINITO_USERS_RENDERED`, at every point listed in [applications.md](applications.md), and `clear: true` drops both facts. `get_merged_users` serves the fact to a templated read when its key matches and renders otherwise."
