msgstr "Adaptoren er det som begrenser det. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` samsvarer ikke med filen. Avslaget skjer i sidebilen, så det holder for hver klient uansett hva hver gjenvinner lokalt."

