msgid "The catalogue run in ``cli/build/i18n`` extracts this repository’s own strings into ``locale/<code>/LC_MESSAGES/*.po`` and fills them through ``make i18n-translate``. It used to call one engine directly. It now goes through this gateway, and deploys the gateway when none answers, because whether an engine keeps a masked span intact is a property of the engine and the language pair, which only a comparison across engines can learn. What the run writes into a catalogue, and which answer it discards, stays with the run."
