# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The privileged `pull_request_target` build switches its **build source** from the base merge ref to the **raw PR head** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`)."
msgstr "Den privilegerte `pull_request_target` Bygg brytere **bygge kilde** fra basen sammenslå ref til **rå PR-hode** (`head.repo.full_name` @ `head.sha`).."

