# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The producer [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) also emits a per-application `groupOfNames` container `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` whose `member` attribute references every role group of that application, so an LDAP-only consumer can still navigate the hierarchy. Keycloak does not rely on those containers; it reconstructs `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` via per-application mappers (see below)."
msgstr "Produsenten [build_ldap_role_entries](../../../../roles/svc-db-openldap/filter_plugins/build_ldap_role_entries.py) Sender også ut en per-applikasjon `groupOfNames` beholder `cn=<application_id>,ou=roles,...` som `member` attribut referanser hver rolle gruppe av det programmet, slik at en LDAP-bare forbrukere fortsatt kan navigere i hierarkiet. Keycloak er ikke avhengig av disse beholdere; den rekonstruerer `/roles/<application_id>/<role_name>` via kartleggere per søknad (Se nedenfor).."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The production-safe path MUST follow Mattermost's documented Agents and MCP deployment guidance."
msgstr "Den produksjonssikre veien må følge Mattermostdokumenterte agenter og MCP utplasseringsveiledning."

msgid "The profile specs red on the onion pass of `/tmp/compose-deploy-iam-20.log` carry spec fixes that never ran: `test-profile-sync.js` builds a website under the 100 characters WordPress allows (`user_url_too_long` rejected the whole sync), `test-profile-lock.js` expects the 501 `application_passwords_disabled` refusal on a non-https base (core issues application passwords only with `is_ssl()`), and reads the form URL through `getAttribute(\"action\")` because the hidden `action` input of `user-edit.php` shadows `form.action`. Open: rerun both specs on an onion and a clearnet pass; decide whether application passwords stay https-only on onion hosts; and let `files/mu-plugins/infinito-oidc-rbac-mapper.php` drop an over-long website claim instead of failing the whole profile sync of that user."
msgstr ""

msgid "The project licence governs this repository's own code. It does not reach the software a role deploys, and that software is where the restriction usually sits: a deployment holding written permission for commercial use of Infinito.Nexus is still barred from NLLB-200's weights, which are CC BY-NC."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project tree's full path list (one walk per process) and per-file UTF-8 contents (`read_text`). Used by lint/integration tests and CLI tools that scan the repo."
msgstr "Prosjekttreets fulle baneliste (én gang per prosess) og per-fil UTF-8 innhold (`read_text`). Brukes av lint/integrasjonstester og CLI-verktøy som skanner repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project's environment is owned by a single generator, not scattered across shell modules. Every variable is documented INLINE next to its definition with a one-line `# ...` comment above the key. This page is just a map of where to look."
msgstr "Prosjektets miljø eies av en enkelt generator, ikke spredt over skallmoduler. Hver variabel dokumenteres INLINE ved siden av sin definisjon med én linje `# ...` kommentar over nøkkelen. Denne siden er bare et kart over hvor du skal se."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project-owned plugin is unaudited: endpoint, transport, auth and tool scope are unverified in source."
msgstr "Prosjekteide plugin er uvedkommende: endepunkt, transport, aut og verktøyområde er uverifisert i kilden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The project-owned server passes ownership, licence, pinning and read-only default, but its HTTP transport serves one session per process, which upstream asserts in `src/test/transport.test.ts` at `v0.3.1`; the deploy probe alone would leave it restart-required."
msgstr "Den prosjekteide serveren passerer eierskap, lisens, pinning og lesebeskyttet standard, men dens HTTP-transport tjener én økt per prosess, som oppstrøms hevder i `src/test/transport.test.ts` på `v0.3.1`; utplasseringssonden alene ville la det omstart-krevet."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The prompt tracks a category stack: typing a bare category name cd's into it, ``..`` walks one level up, ``/`` returns to root, path tokens with ``/`` or ``..`` navigate, ``infinito [path]`` jumps absolute, ``ls`` lists the current folder, everything else runs with the current path prepended."
msgstr "Den hurtigsporer en kategoristabel: å skrive inn et bare kategorinavn cd i den, ``..`` Gå et nivå opp, ``/`` returnerer til rot, banetegn med ``/`` eller ``..`` navigere, ``infinito [path]`` hopper absolutt, ``ls`` lister gjeldende mappe, alt annet kjører med gjeldende sti forhåndsavhengig."

