# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) on Arch Linux systems. GCC is a standard compiler suite supporting C, C++, and other programming languages. It is a core component for compiling and building software from source."
msgstr "Denne ansible rollen installerer GNU Compiler Collection (GCC) på Arch Linux-systemer. GCC er en standard kompilator suite som støtter C, C++ og andre programmeringsspråk. Det er en kjernekomponent for å samle og bygge programvare fra kilden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the Intel VA-API media driver for the current Linux distribution."
msgstr "Denne Ansible rollen installerer Intel VA-API mediedriver for den aktuelle Linux-distribusjonen."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role installs the [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop client on Arch Linux systems using the [AUR (Arch User Repository)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/)."
msgstr "Denne ansible rollen installerer [Spotify](https://www.spotify.com/) desktop klient på Arch Linux systemer ved hjelp av [AUR (Arch User Lager)](https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/spotify/).."

