msgid "This role deploys XWiki using Docker, automating the installation, configuration, and management of your XWiki server. It integrates with an relational database and a reverse proxy. The role supports advanced features such as global CSS injection, Matomo analytics, OIDC authentication, and centralized logout, making it a powerful and customizable solution within the Infinito.Nexus ecosystem."
msgstr "Denne rollen distribueres XWiki Bruk Docker, automatiser installasjon, konfigurasjon og styring av din XWiki server. Den integrerer med en relasjonell database og en omvendt proxy. Rollen støtter avanserte funksjoner som global CSS injeksjon, Matomo Analyser, OIDC-autentisering og sentralisert utlogging, noe som gjør det til en kraftig og tilpasningsbar løsning i Infinito.Nexus økosystem."

msgid "This role deploys Zammad as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``ghcr.io/zammad/zammad`` image (Rails app, WebSocket, scheduler, nginx, plus a one-shot init container that bypasses the setup wizard via ``auto_wizard.json``). Search is provided by a bundled Elasticsearch container; PostgreSQL, Redis and Memcached are consumed from the central ``svc-db-*`` providers via ``sys-stk-full``. Authentication uses direct OpenID Connect against the shared Keycloak client; LDAP federation and SMTP/IMAP via the mail server (`web-app-email <../web-app-email/>`__) are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role deploys Zammad as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream `ghcr.io/zammad/zammad` image (Rails app, WebSocket, scheduler, nginx, plus a one-shot init container that bypasses the setup wizard via `auto_wizard.json`). Search is provided by a bundled Elasticsearch container; PostgreSQL, Redis and Memcached are consumed from the central `svc-db-*` providers via `sys-stk-full`. Authentication uses direct OpenID Connect against the shared Keycloak client; LDAP federation and SMTP/IMAP via the mail server ([web-app-email](../web-app-email/)) are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr ""

