# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: komponere ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; sverm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (delt-overlay alias) for app frontend, eller ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` Navngitte sidebiler (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app kjører node-lokal under sverm og publiserer sin lokale port til verten, så den overlegg-ansatte proxy når det på ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via vertsporten (Oppringeren setter dette av den virkelige DEPLOYMENT_MODE, siden slike apper tvinger en komposisjon-stil gjengivelse). manglende sverm interne port hardt-feil."

